<%# The chat, a key piece of the game (decision), an island at the bottom right (maquette C): low by default, so that
    the board keeps the screen, its height changed by the handle at its top (dragged, or the arrow keys once it has the
    focus) and folded by its button, both kept in this browser (chat_island_controller.js; the handle and the button
    rendered hidden and shown by it). Folded, 60 px high like the other islands (its header 58 px inside its
    border). Its feed (ChatMessage): the last lines of the table, then those sent live by GameTableChannel, messages
    typed at the table and events written by the server (an item given), then the field to write. From 1024 px: on a
    smaller screen it will need a place of its own. « Afficher le chat » (Paramètres › Affichage) hides it altogether %>
<aside class="<%= GameRoomHelper::ISLAND_CLASSES %> absolute right-4 bottom-4 z-20 hidden w-80 flex-col lg:flex"
       aria-labelledby="game-room-chat-title" data-controller="chat-island"
       data-action="game-room-chat:change@window->chat-island#showOrHide"
       data-chat-island-fold-label-value="<%= t(".fold") %>" data-chat-island-unfold-label-value="<%= t(".unfold") %>">
  <div hidden role="separator" tabindex="0" aria-orientation="horizontal" aria-controls="game-room-chat-body"
       aria-label="<%= t(".resize") %>" title="<%= t(".resize") %>"
       class="group flex h-3 cursor-ns-resize touch-none items-center justify-center rounded-t-xl focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring"
       data-chat-island-target="handle"
       data-action="pointerdown->chat-island#startResize keydown->chat-island#resizeWithKeys">
    <span class="h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-line transition-colors group-hover:bg-field-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>
  <header class="flex h-[58px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2 px-4">
    <%= render "shared/icons/message_square_text", css_class: "size-5 text-muted" %>
    <h2 id="game-room-chat-title" class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink"><%= t(".title") %></h2>
    <button type="button" hidden class="<%= button_classes(:quiet, size: :compact_icon) %> group/fold ml-auto"
            aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="game-room-chat-body" aria-label="<%= t(".fold") %>"
            title="<%= t(".fold") %>" data-chat-island-target="toggle" data-action="chat-island#toggle">
      <%= render "shared/icons/chevron_down", css_class: "size-4 transition-transform group-aria-[expanded=false]/fold:rotate-180" %>
    </button>
  </header>
  <div id="game-room-chat-body" class="flex h-64 flex-col border-t border-line" data-chat-island-target="body"
       data-controller="chat-feed" data-chat-feed-current-user-id-value="<%= current_user.id %>">
    <div class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 py-3" data-chat-feed-target="scroller">
      <p class="text-sm text-muted [&:has(+ol>li)]:hidden"><%= t(".empty") %></p>
      <ol id="<%= ChatMessage::FEED_TARGET %>" class="space-y-3" role="log" aria-labelledby="game-room-chat-title">
        <%= render partial: "game_rooms/chat_line", collection: game_room.chat_feed, as: :line %>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <%= render "game_rooms/chat_form", game_table: game_room.game_table %>
  </div>
</aside>
